	],
	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nYfwAhzv-aGIu3cFe",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 12, DX 12, IQ 3, HT 13, HP 12, WILL 8, PER 9, FP 13, SPEED 6.25, MOVE 6, DODGE 9, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nU79HGkU96W3FAdXX",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 18 (offense 13, protection 5), threat tier minor, appearing 2."
		},
		{
			"id": "n1Vls3ivdgINAru-j",
			"text": "Toxic Skin: Toxic Skin: Reach C. Anything that bites or grapples the toad bare-handed rolls HT or is nauseated and blurred of vision for minutes. No attack roll; contact alone does it."
		},
		{
			"id": "nX53XH4NzNsZ-VJfd",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/giant-toad.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "n8VBpnRg3vfHlZeWZ",
			"text": "Independent build total: -44 points of racial traits plus 12 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "n_yn1duADbdADOdMi",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Giant Toad (SRD 5.1). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nB2hEznaf-MJQwtGB",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nJ-u1wLqsDA4pWVnT",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 100 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nDmclhvMrJzVDFpsQ",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 6 (primary); water Move 6. The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "niBZ0jTwkOkDDkFJP",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nPRdGcXrZkrGpsXIq",
			"text": "About 1.5 m gathered, which is the SM 0 row. An earlier draft had it a step larger, sized from mass rather than from the published length table."
		},
		{
			"id": "nYDbCRktD0XA3bXkv",
			"text": "ST from Basic Lift: it swallows something the weight of a halfling."
		},
		{
			"id": "nBYdSluPqrJU0WhWI",
			"text": "DR 0 is deliberate. An amphibian's skin is thin, wet and permeable — which is also what makes the toxin work. The toughness is in HT and HP, not hide."
		},
		{
			"id": "n0g32S5Hoi9SKSgvb",
			"text": "Added after a post-hoc comparison against independent GURPS fan conversions of this creature: Peripheral Vision. The comparison surfaced the gap; the build is still ours."
		},
		{
			"id": "noutTsNjlcAvcHy6P",
			"text": "Monster statistics, ratings and description prose by Monsters on Automatic; AI-generated first draft, project-reviewed, released under CC BY 4.0."
		}
	],
